WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.170
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:08.440 --> 00:09.980
Have you ever thought about me?

3
00:10.360 --> 00:11.220
You can do whatever you want,

4
00:11.240 --> 00:12.630
but I can't.

5
00:14.230 --> 00:15.000
Fight.

6
00:15.460 --> 00:16.970
You don't know anything

7
00:17.430 --> 00:18.530
about us or my training.

8
00:19.970 --> 00:20.710
Whoa...

9
00:29.930 --> 00:31.090
I trusted you with this.

10
00:31.110 --> 00:32.509
What the hell have you done?

11
00:32.910 --> 00:34.730
P'Ing, I didn't do it.

12
00:49.630 --> 00:51.010
Dammit, Yok.

13
00:57.250 --> 00:59.310
That boxer hits like a damn truck.

14
01:02.890 --> 01:03.760
Dammit.

15
01:09.400 --> 01:10.210
Jeez.

16
01:12.310 --> 01:13.470
God, what the hell?

17
01:17.650 --> 01:18.570
Who is it?

18
01:20.090 --> 01:20.840
Mr. Phet?

19
01:23.310 --> 01:24.210
Hello, Mr. Phet.

20
01:24.490 --> 01:25.650
Hello, Mr. Ing.

21
01:25.670 --> 01:27.120
My family went out for a meal yesterday,

22
01:27.150 --> 01:28.910
and the staff at the restaurant told me what happened.

23
01:28.930 --> 01:31.150
-I'm really sorry for what Yok did. -Oh.

24
01:31.539 --> 01:32.860
Is that all it was?

25
01:32.940 --> 01:34.690
I don't mind at all.

26
01:35.120 --> 01:36.229
I've told him to apologize to you

27
01:36.259 --> 01:37.440
in person at your house.

28
01:38.289 --> 01:39.710
Oh, come on.

29
01:39.910 --> 01:42.539
You're worrying too much.

30
01:43.100 --> 01:44.770
Oh, so Yok is on his way?

31
01:45.009 --> 01:46.770
Alright, I'll wait for him.

32
01:46.800 --> 01:48.289
I'm really sorry, Mr. Ing.

33
01:48.490 --> 01:49.479
Thank you very much.

34
01:51.630 --> 01:54.620
Finally, someone has managed to tame him.

35
02:00.020 --> 02:01.350
Whoa.

36
02:04.120 --> 02:05.750
Didn't take you long, kid.

37
02:16.660 --> 02:18.530
You said you were done with me,

38
02:18.700 --> 02:20.870
yet here you are, dragging yourself all the way here.

39
02:21.810 --> 02:22.860
I'm here to apologize.

40
02:24.490 --> 02:25.320
Apologize?

41
02:32.130 --> 02:32.930
Seriously?

42
02:33.720 --> 02:35.160
Is that how you apologize?

43
02:36.300 --> 02:37.390
I'm sorry.

44
02:38.890 --> 02:40.650
I planned to just drop these off

45
02:40.680 --> 02:41.660
and then call you.

46
02:42.600 --> 02:44.670
But since you're here anyway,

47
02:44.910 --> 02:46.210
I'll say it to your face.

48
02:46.620 --> 02:47.540
I'm sorry.

49
02:49.090 --> 02:49.970
I mean,

50
02:50.390 --> 02:52.010
I thought you'd be out on a date,

51
02:53.220 --> 02:54.520
so I didn't want to bother you.

52
02:57.400 --> 02:58.350
I told you last time.

53
02:58.380 --> 03:00.020
If you're jealous, just say so.

54
03:01.190 --> 03:02.460
I can explain.

55
03:09.250 --> 03:10.160
Here.

56
03:12.740 --> 03:13.460
I'm off.

57
03:15.020 --> 03:16.220
Hey, hold on.

58
03:25.090 --> 03:26.420
Make me some shrimp porridge.

59
03:30.100 --> 03:32.090
And are you going to pour it over my head again?

60
03:37.230 --> 03:37.930
Have you been nice

61
03:37.950 --> 03:39.840
enough for me to be nice to you?

62
03:42.829 --> 03:44.720
Suit yourself. If you don't wanna do it, fine.

63
03:45.250 --> 03:46.990
I'll just send all this trash

64
03:47.150 --> 03:49.680
straight to your brother, okay?

65
03:52.280 --> 03:53.180
Suit yourself.

66
03:53.210 --> 03:54.520
Wait, hold on.

67
03:57.829 --> 03:59.170
If I make it, we're done, right?

68
04:31.340 --> 04:32.490
Yeah, fine.

69
04:33.020 --> 04:34.400
I guess I can forgive you.

70
04:37.159 --> 04:38.430
I'm free next week.

71
04:38.590 --> 04:40.230
I'm taking two people from the agriculture company

72
04:40.250 --> 04:41.500
to visit the site in Pattaya.

73
04:43.970 --> 04:45.230
Your brother is coming, too.

74
04:45.740 --> 04:47.150
Are you okay with the date?

75
04:49.850 --> 04:50.600
Yes.

76
05:26.340 --> 05:27.350
This is terrible.

77
05:48.300 --> 05:51.430
♪ Love me so much it hurts, ♪

78
05:52.430 --> 05:55.390
♪ But you never let it show ♪

79
05:56.700 --> 05:58.940
♪ Choosing silence, you'd never let me know ♪

80
06:01.650 --> 06:04.530
♪ Oh, oh ♪

81
06:05.670 --> 06:08.870
♪ How many endings can love hold? ♪

82
06:10.130 --> 06:12.240
♪ Only one, the same old ♪

83
06:14.880 --> 06:16.130
♪ Wake up all the night ♪

84
06:16.160 --> 06:17.400
♪ Stay out of matter ♪

85
06:17.420 --> 06:18.940
♪ Maybe it won't hurt as much ♪

86
06:18.970 --> 06:22.980
♪ If I just sleep the day away ♪

87
06:26.420 --> 06:28.800
♪ I think you're like a masterpiece, ♪

88
06:28.830 --> 06:30.550
♪ But I mess it up ♪

89
06:30.590 --> 06:33.480
♪ Don't wanna walk a step behind it ♪

90
06:33.860 --> 06:35.310
♪ A step behind you ♪

91
06:36.950 --> 06:38.580
♪ A step behind you ♪

92
07:08.850 --> 07:11.900
♪ I'm always a step behind ♪

93
07:11.980 --> 07:15.260
♪ I'm always a step behind ♪

94
07:18.580 --> 07:21.880
♪ I think you're like a masterpiece, ♪

95
07:21.900 --> 07:23.460
♪ But I mess it up ♪

96
07:23.540 --> 07:26.470
♪ Don't wanna walk a step behind it ♪

97
07:26.900 --> 07:28.540
♪ A step behind you ♪

98
07:29.310 --> 07:31.840
♪ I'm always a step behind ♪

99
07:34.270 --> 07:35.659
♪ Love me... ♪

100
07:51.940 --> 07:52.760
Jeez.

101
07:53.300 --> 07:55.270
I've been practicing for so long.

102
07:56.300 --> 07:58.090
Thought I'd be able to hold you back.

103
08:01.700 --> 08:03.160
You'll surpass me in no time.

104
08:03.520 --> 08:05.010
I won't be playing much anymore.

105
08:07.200 --> 08:08.000
Why not?

106
08:09.840 --> 08:11.240
I passed the tryouts.

107
08:13.060 --> 08:14.600
I have to sign a contract and go to America.

108
08:16.240 --> 08:18.090
Once I become a professional boxer,

109
08:18.200 --> 08:19.540
I won't have much time for this.

110
08:20.210 --> 08:22.180
Hey, congratulations.

111
08:23.120 --> 08:24.270
But...

112
08:26.200 --> 08:27.550
you're not running away

113
08:29.500 --> 08:31.170
just because you fell for my brother, are you?

114
08:35.970 --> 08:36.789
No.

115
08:37.190 --> 08:38.220
What are you talking about?

116
08:41.320 --> 08:43.100
That was rude, you know.

117
08:44.380 --> 08:45.780
Well, since you're leaving,

118
08:46.050 --> 08:47.590
I just wanted to tease you.

119
08:53.040 --> 08:53.940
Another round?

120
09:12.680 --> 09:14.090
What's your take on this project?

121
09:15.000 --> 09:16.680
It's not worth investing in yet.

122
09:16.880 --> 09:18.540
They have control over all the key technology,

123
09:18.570 --> 09:19.580
which puts us in a weak position.

124
09:21.020 --> 09:21.940
Keep going.

125
09:22.610 --> 09:23.770
We should let them

126
09:23.790 --> 09:25.220
apply for the license first,

127
09:25.250 --> 09:26.500
then decide what to do next.

128
09:29.040 --> 09:30.200
Good read on the situation.

129
09:31.360 --> 09:33.560
You'll be in charge of this project,

130
09:34.110 --> 09:36.190
so do your homework and make sure you seal the deal.

131
09:38.260 --> 09:39.160
Understood.

132
09:53.520 --> 09:56.500
If that's settled, let's proceed as we agreed.

133
09:56.820 --> 09:57.680
Cheers.

134
10:03.770 --> 10:04.850
Well...

135
10:06.920 --> 10:09.820
we found that some of the documents are still incomplete,

136
10:10.420 --> 10:13.140
so we'd like to push it back for another two days.

137
10:13.330 --> 10:16.820
That would be for the best.

138
10:17.640 --> 10:18.650
Oh, I see.

139
10:19.580 --> 10:20.980
Well, Mr. Phet.

140
10:22.880 --> 10:24.960
Can we reschedule the meeting with them?

141
10:32.800 --> 10:34.530
If they're having technical issues,

142
10:34.840 --> 10:37.920
we should give them some time.

143
10:42.520 --> 10:43.970
In that case, Mr. Phet,

144
10:44.220 --> 10:44.870
if possible,

145
10:44.890 --> 10:47.340
could we make it this Thursday or Friday?

146
10:47.360 --> 10:48.680
I have to go to Samui on Saturday.

147
10:49.220 --> 10:50.100
Of course.

148
10:50.810 --> 10:53.560
We'll get everything sorted out as soon as possible.

149
10:56.920 --> 10:57.950
Thank you very much.

150
10:59.650 --> 11:01.400
Now, let's eat.

151
11:02.620 --> 11:03.850
-Yes. -Sure.

152
11:06.940 --> 11:07.810
Want some shrimp?

153
11:08.860 --> 11:09.690
No, thanks.

154
11:26.740 --> 11:27.680
-Alright. -What do you think?

155
11:48.880 --> 11:50.180
The location is quite promising.

156
11:50.300 --> 11:52.140
I'll need everyone to prepare the documents

157
11:52.160 --> 11:53.590
and follow through with the plan.

158
11:53.620 --> 11:55.600
Let's meet up again in a month.

159
11:56.150 --> 11:58.960
That'll give Mr. Phet time to persuade the others

160
11:58.980 --> 11:59.980
to join the project.

161
12:01.060 --> 12:03.740
No problem at all. You can count on us.

162
12:04.330 --> 12:05.740
Alright then, goodbye.

163
12:06.440 --> 12:07.260
Goodbye.

164
12:13.780 --> 12:14.500
Wait.

165
12:27.330 --> 12:28.130
Samui?

166
12:32.900 --> 12:34.900
Secretary Piang said the tickets are non-refundable.

167
12:35.400 --> 12:36.630
If you want to come, then come.

168
12:37.140 --> 12:38.430
I won't force you if you don't want to.

169
12:55.140 --> 12:55.800
Okay.

170
13:02.860 --> 13:05.100
Why should I have to beg him?

171
13:10.420 --> 13:11.600
Mr. Ing, I'll keep you updated.

172
13:11.620 --> 13:12.500
Got it.

173
13:46.850 --> 13:48.630
Hello.

174
13:52.500 --> 13:54.500
You've come at the wrong time, sir.

175
13:54.610 --> 13:56.450
A storm has just decided to roll in.

176
13:58.280 --> 13:59.740
I'm leaving in two days.

177
14:00.150 --> 14:01.920
Can we even do a site visit in this weather?

178
14:02.340 --> 14:04.600
If the rain lets up tomorrow, it's still possible.

179
14:04.950 --> 14:06.100
Even though construction has halted,

180
14:06.120 --> 14:07.850
we can still inspect the site.

181
14:09.380 --> 14:10.820
Let's play it by ear tomorrow.

182
14:11.240 --> 14:11.930
Yes, sir.

183
14:12.700 --> 14:14.530
Then, please head to your rooms and get some rest,

184
14:14.550 --> 14:16.140
both you and your assistant.

185
14:33.890 --> 14:36.050
What's with all this damn rain?

186
14:41.910 --> 14:43.440
Don't be rude, sweetie.

187
14:43.530 --> 14:45.130
Apologize to him now.

188
14:45.670 --> 14:46.600
I'm sorry.

189
14:46.630 --> 14:47.600
Oh, it's fine.

190
14:47.810 --> 14:48.990
Let him have his fun.

191
14:49.130 --> 14:50.440
Are you swimming all by yourself?

192
14:51.020 --> 14:52.780
Want me to keep you company?

193
15:04.030 --> 15:05.040
That was a direct hit.

194
15:10.240 --> 15:11.580
It must be nice being kids.

195
15:11.890 --> 15:14.500
They can still have fun no matter how bad the storm is.

196
15:16.100 --> 15:17.600
Sure, the kids have fun,

197
15:17.830 --> 15:21.140
but the parents are stuck and can't go anywhere,

198
15:21.270 --> 15:22.890
having to keep an eye on them.

199
15:24.060 --> 15:24.930
I know.

200
15:28.250 --> 15:29.650
I've found him.

201
15:32.850 --> 15:34.930
I have to keep an eye on him all day and night.

202
15:40.390 --> 15:41.270
Leaving already?

203
15:42.620 --> 15:45.720
You certainly know how to look for pleasure, don't you?

204
15:46.660 --> 15:48.380
Is this your friend?

205
15:48.770 --> 15:49.500
Yes,

206
15:49.810 --> 15:50.620
he is.

207
16:02.960 --> 16:04.650
Is it that unbearable

208
16:04.670 --> 16:05.980
to sleep alone for just one night?

209
16:06.880 --> 16:07.930
What is your problem?

210
16:10.310 --> 16:11.220
The second we arrive,

211
16:11.250 --> 16:13.920
you're sitting here laughing with a stranger.

212
16:14.460 --> 16:15.530
Aren't you afraid at all?

213
16:20.450 --> 16:21.130
What's so funny?

214
16:24.080 --> 16:25.410
I've been wondering

215
16:25.430 --> 16:27.680
why you made such a scene at Leo's place.

216
16:27.880 --> 16:29.310
I finally get it.

217
16:29.800 --> 16:31.660
You just don't understand your own feelings.

218
16:32.090 --> 16:33.420
When I was chasing you,

219
16:33.610 --> 16:34.740
you ignored me.

220
16:34.760 --> 16:36.460
But now that I've stopped, you're upset.

221
16:36.590 --> 16:39.060
Do you realize you're being such a psycho?

222
16:39.280 --> 16:40.290
You always need someone

223
16:40.310 --> 16:42.700
running after you.

224
16:47.320 --> 16:49.140
I already told you, I'm not jealous of you.

225
16:49.170 --> 16:50.780
-You're so full of yourself. -Yeah, fine.

226
16:50.830 --> 16:52.340
Whatever. Think what you want.

227
16:52.370 --> 16:53.480
I don't care anymore

228
16:53.600 --> 16:54.530
because I'm not gonna commit

229
16:54.550 --> 16:56.120
to just you.

230
16:56.150 --> 16:57.450
I'm going to have my own fun, okay?

231
16:58.000 --> 16:58.740
P'Ing,

232
16:59.220 --> 17:00.480
we need to sort this out first.

233
17:02.240 --> 17:04.079
We're in public, you know.

234
17:25.800 --> 17:27.530
You know why this suits you?

235
17:27.550 --> 17:28.740
Let me tell you something.

236
17:29.950 --> 17:31.300
Just take this.

237
17:31.320 --> 17:32.930
Open your damn eyes and look.

238
17:33.240 --> 17:34.340
He's here with his son.

239
17:37.690 --> 17:38.700
Look at me.

240
17:39.280 --> 17:40.330
You idiot.

241
18:22.180 --> 18:24.640
Mr. Ing, we only have half a day.

242
18:24.660 --> 18:26.970
Any later and the rain will start pouring down again.

243
18:27.030 --> 18:28.170
Alright, let's go.

244
18:28.190 --> 18:29.250
Hello, Mr. Ing.

245
18:31.560 --> 18:32.290
Which way?

246
18:32.310 --> 18:33.490
-This way, please. -Right this way.

247
18:55.280 --> 18:56.380
This way, please.

248
19:05.320 --> 19:06.250
Since it's right by the sea,

249
19:06.280 --> 19:08.200
you have to be extra careful with the paint.

250
19:09.770 --> 19:11.580
Because if a problem arises later,

251
19:11.610 --> 19:12.900
it'll be a nightmare to fix.

252
19:14.040 --> 19:16.100
The materials we're using are top-grade

253
19:16.120 --> 19:17.230
and guaranteed to be moisture-resistant

254
19:17.260 --> 19:18.570
and insect-proof.

255
19:18.740 --> 19:19.470
I see.

256
19:21.330 --> 19:22.280
Mr. Ing,

257
19:23.460 --> 19:25.140
do you have some free time today?

258
19:25.210 --> 19:27.400
The higher-ups found out you were in town,

259
19:27.430 --> 19:29.440
so they'd like to invite you to dinner.

260
19:30.830 --> 19:31.710
How did they find out?

261
19:31.740 --> 19:33.090
I'm not sure myself.

262
19:33.450 --> 19:34.950
Since your visit was quite sudden,

263
19:34.970 --> 19:36.190
we didn't notify anyone.

264
19:36.360 --> 19:38.720
But for some reason, word has gotten out to everyone.

265
19:46.490 --> 19:47.580
You should go, Mr. Ing.

266
19:47.790 --> 19:49.420
I'll handle things here.

267
19:53.820 --> 19:54.570
Alright.

268
19:54.950 --> 19:56.240
I'm counting on you, then.

269
19:56.480 --> 19:58.170
Record everything and send the video to me.

270
19:58.380 --> 20:00.160
If you have any questions, ask the foreman.

271
20:00.940 --> 20:01.740
Yes, sir.

272
20:07.050 --> 20:07.850
You sure you're up for it?

273
20:09.340 --> 20:10.140
I'm sure.

274
20:12.460 --> 20:13.860
-This way, please. -Okay.

275
20:50.090 --> 20:51.830
[Call me when you see this. Need to discuss work.]

276
20:51.850 --> 20:52.660
[Read]

277
20:56.760 --> 20:57.940
[Please avoid outdoor activities.]

278
20:57.970 --> 20:59.400
[A major storm is approaching the island.]

279
20:59.420 --> 21:00.580
[Residents are advised to stay indoors.]

280
21:02.480 --> 21:03.280
[Please avoid outdoor activities.]

281
21:03.300 --> 21:04.230
[A major storm is approaching the island.]

282
21:04.250 --> 21:04.980
[Residents are advised to stay indoors.]

283
21:06.520 --> 21:07.040
[Please avoid outdoor activities.]

284
21:07.070 --> 21:07.740
[A major storm is approaching the island.]

285
21:07.760 --> 21:08.220
[Residents are advised to stay indoors.]

286
21:14.400 --> 21:15.200
Yok...

287
21:26.280 --> 21:27.980
Why the hell isn't he picking up?

288
21:32.850 --> 21:33.650
Yok.

289
21:34.360 --> 21:35.160
Yok.

290
21:35.740 --> 21:36.910
Are you in there?

291
21:43.250 --> 21:45.620
-P'Ing? -Hey, where are you?

292
21:45.650 --> 21:47.290
I'm still at the site.

293
21:47.610 --> 21:49.420
Something hit me in the shoulder.

294
21:49.450 --> 21:50.890
-What? -It really hurts.

295
21:50.910 --> 21:52.090
Yok? Hey.

296
22:02.800 --> 22:03.590
Hello?

297
22:04.710 --> 22:06.070
My assistant is trapped at the site.

298
22:06.090 --> 22:08.020
Get the gear ready and get me a car.

299
22:21.420 --> 22:23.310
Mr. Ing, we've already notified the police.

300
22:23.340 --> 22:24.370
This is mine, right?

301
22:24.410 --> 22:26.880
We can wait until the storm passes.

302
22:26.910 --> 22:28.220
It'll be too late by then.

303
22:28.250 --> 22:29.050
Mr. Ing...

304
22:29.290 --> 22:31.610
He's with me. He's my responsibility.

305
22:33.240 --> 22:34.910
I've never been afraid of anything in my life

306
22:35.440 --> 22:37.640
except death itself.

307
22:37.970 --> 22:39.730
That's something determined by fate,

308
22:39.750 --> 22:40.750
not by us mortals.

309
23:04.130 --> 23:06.540
[Yok]

310
23:09.370 --> 23:10.550
Why isn't he picking up?

311
23:13.460 --> 23:15.370
[Yok]

312
23:15.430 --> 23:17.220
Yok, I'm on my way.

313
23:17.270 --> 23:18.080
P'Ing...

314
23:18.190 --> 23:19.870
Stay on the line. Don't fall asleep.

315
23:20.020 --> 23:21.060
I'm rushing there.

316
23:21.360 --> 23:22.240
Don't close your eyes.

317
23:22.260 --> 23:23.610
It's so cold...

318
23:24.700 --> 23:25.500
Yok.

319
23:28.390 --> 23:31.760
The number you are calling cannot be reached at this time.

320
24:33.700 --> 24:34.590
Yok.

321
24:35.870 --> 24:36.830
Yok.

322
24:41.160 --> 24:42.060
Yok.

323
24:45.270 --> 24:46.150
Yok.

324
24:47.550 --> 24:48.310
Yok.

325
24:59.310 --> 25:00.220
Yok...

326
25:23.040 --> 25:24.020
Yok.

327
25:45.060 --> 25:46.250
Yok.

328
25:54.900 --> 25:55.750
Yok.

329
26:08.280 --> 26:09.490
P'Ing...

330
26:10.320 --> 26:11.370
Yok.

331
26:51.170 --> 26:52.200
P'Ing...

332
27:13.480 --> 27:14.440
P'Ing...

333
27:22.030 --> 27:22.830
P'Ing...

334
27:23.530 --> 27:24.330
Yok.

335
27:25.670 --> 27:26.470
Yok.

336
27:28.520 --> 27:29.700
Can you hear me?

337
27:31.580 --> 27:32.710
Which floor are you on?

338
27:33.560 --> 27:34.360
Yok.

339
27:36.790 --> 27:37.670
Yok.

340
27:40.560 --> 27:41.540
P'Ing...

341
27:41.690 --> 27:42.490
Yok.

342
27:43.980 --> 27:44.830
Yok.

343
27:45.660 --> 27:46.880
Can you hear me?

344
27:48.880 --> 27:49.680
Yok.

345
27:52.130 --> 27:52.910
Yok.

346
27:53.810 --> 27:54.740
P'Ing...

347
27:55.590 --> 27:56.370
Yok?

348
27:57.900 --> 27:58.680
Yok.

349
28:03.100 --> 28:03.930
P'Ing...

350
28:04.530 --> 28:05.190
Yok.

351
28:07.840 --> 28:08.760
Yok.

352
28:09.370 --> 28:10.070
Yok...

353
28:10.590 --> 28:11.270
Yok.

354
28:12.160 --> 28:12.820
Hey.

355
28:19.450 --> 28:20.630
You're here...

356
28:21.410 --> 28:23.090
If you can talk, it means you're not dead yet.

357
28:24.020 --> 28:25.220
Are you badly hurt anywhere?

358
28:28.430 --> 28:29.230
Dammit.

359
28:29.910 --> 28:31.980
We can't leave in this weather.

360
28:32.830 --> 28:33.600
Hold on a second.

361
28:38.600 --> 28:39.920
Dammit...

362
28:40.910 --> 28:41.710
Are you okay?

363
28:42.910 --> 28:44.160
My phone's not working.

364
28:45.360 --> 28:46.700
It got wet.

365
28:47.910 --> 28:48.850
Just a second.

366
28:53.820 --> 28:54.620
Where is it?

367
28:55.650 --> 28:56.740
Jeez.

368
28:57.710 --> 28:58.850
How bad is the pain?

369
29:00.900 --> 29:02.140
Does it feel like you've broken a bone?

370
29:02.890 --> 29:03.730
No.

371
29:03.990 --> 29:04.910
Anywhere else?

372
29:05.450 --> 29:06.340
Dammit.

373
29:07.150 --> 29:08.130
On your neck, too.

374
29:08.510 --> 29:09.690
Hold this for a second.

375
29:11.890 --> 29:13.030
I need to clean your wounds first.

376
29:15.990 --> 29:17.990
I've never actually treated wounds before.

377
29:21.710 --> 29:22.880
Why are you staring at me?

378
29:24.440 --> 29:25.090
What?

379
29:26.240 --> 29:27.140
Is something wrong?

380
29:28.690 --> 29:29.960
You're alright, aren't you?

381
29:47.020 --> 29:48.280
Yok, I'm telling you now.

382
29:48.310 --> 29:50.080
I've never done this for anyone else.

383
29:50.890 --> 29:54.060
So don't blame me if it hurts.

384
29:54.520 --> 29:55.160
Come here.

385
30:03.310 --> 30:05.630
Come on, it's my first time doing this.

386
30:06.090 --> 30:06.990
Just bear with it.

387
30:07.440 --> 30:08.910
Yeah, wouldn't want it getting infected.

388
30:12.690 --> 30:13.910
There's another one on your neck, right?

389
30:14.470 --> 30:15.840
God, it's massive.

390
30:19.650 --> 30:20.790
Yeah, just hold on.

391
30:20.920 --> 30:22.340
Yok, hang in there.

392
30:23.150 --> 30:24.260
I've never done this.

393
30:26.380 --> 30:27.590
They'll heal in no time.

394
30:31.810 --> 30:33.080
It hurts me just looking at you.

395
30:36.880 --> 30:37.770
You'll be fine.

396
30:48.790 --> 30:49.590
Want more?

397
30:52.030 --> 30:52.830
Want some more?

398
30:53.460 --> 30:54.610
That's enough.

399
30:55.830 --> 30:57.160
I even brought some crackers

400
30:57.190 --> 30:58.240
to keep you going.

401
30:58.830 --> 31:00.000
You'd better thank me.

402
31:01.110 --> 31:03.360
Guys like me don't come around often, you know.

403
31:05.120 --> 31:05.810
Here.

404
31:10.510 --> 31:12.000
Eat up. Come on.

405
31:20.730 --> 31:21.490
What?

406
31:23.370 --> 31:24.950
I think you need to change your shirt.

407
31:25.080 --> 31:26.310
I brought a spare one.

408
31:26.540 --> 31:29.290
See? I've literally brought you everything.

409
31:33.090 --> 31:33.800
P'Ing...

410
31:34.640 --> 31:35.440
What?

411
31:36.010 --> 31:37.210
Are you hurt?

412
31:37.230 --> 31:38.280
I'm not.

413
31:38.310 --> 31:39.480
You should worry about yourself.

414
31:39.550 --> 31:41.270
Damn, just eat this.

415
31:41.750 --> 31:42.570
P'Ing,

416
31:42.910 --> 31:43.980
your arm...

417
31:44.410 --> 31:45.180
What's wrong with it?

418
31:45.600 --> 31:47.670
Wait, that is my blood.

419
31:50.500 --> 31:53.180
You should take off your shirt so I can treat the wound.

420
31:53.400 --> 31:54.970
Damn, is it bad?

421
31:55.740 --> 31:57.800
It's probably nothing. Just a small scratch.

422
31:59.170 --> 32:00.580
Check my arm.

423
32:03.870 --> 32:04.910
Are there many wounds?

424
32:08.940 --> 32:10.280
-P'Ing. -What?

425
32:10.820 --> 32:11.650
Your back.

426
32:11.670 --> 32:12.350
My back?

427
32:12.900 --> 32:13.700
Oh...

428
32:14.430 --> 32:15.120
Damn it.

429
32:15.240 --> 32:16.090
God...

430
32:16.570 --> 32:17.370
I think...

431
32:18.430 --> 32:19.230
Ow.

432
32:20.230 --> 32:21.080
Jeez.

433
32:21.530 --> 32:24.990
Something must have slashed my back while I was running.

434
32:25.280 --> 32:26.750
Stay still.

435
32:26.780 --> 32:27.690
Damn.

436
32:28.540 --> 32:30.550
Dammit, what is this?

437
32:40.000 --> 32:41.200
Hey, be gentle.

438
32:46.270 --> 32:47.070
Easy does it.

439
32:48.790 --> 32:49.890
Stay still.

440
32:53.310 --> 32:53.920
Ow.

441
32:54.670 --> 32:56.620
It hurts like hell.

442
32:56.720 --> 32:58.180
Be more gentle, damn it.

443
32:58.900 --> 33:00.760
I don't know how to do this, either.

444
33:01.760 --> 33:03.420
I shouldn't have given you a hard time.

445
33:03.440 --> 33:05.000
Damn...

446
33:08.820 --> 33:09.950
Just bear with it.

447
33:15.650 --> 33:18.420
Yok, be gentle.

448
33:25.210 --> 33:26.800
Come on, move closer.

449
33:33.360 --> 33:34.350
You should get some sleep.

450
33:35.750 --> 33:37.350
If the weather clears up tomorrow,

451
33:38.580 --> 33:40.050
someone will eventually come for us.

452
33:47.720 --> 33:48.570
P'Ing...

453
33:49.610 --> 33:52.160
I didn't think you'd actually come for me.

454
33:55.380 --> 33:56.480
To be honest,

455
33:58.370 --> 33:59.920
if you hadn't been getting on my nerves,

456
34:00.740 --> 34:02.190
I might have gotten here even sooner.

457
34:08.590 --> 34:09.880
Why are you staring at me?

458
34:11.909 --> 34:13.510
Are you moved by my heroics?

459
34:18.219 --> 34:20.199
Fine, I'll stop teasing you.

460
34:23.280 --> 34:27.389
♪ You're the hush after rain ♪

461
34:27.420 --> 34:30.900
♪ A calm that I can't name ♪

462
34:30.920 --> 34:34.060
♪ Not a storm, just a glow ♪

463
34:34.520 --> 34:37.320
♪ Where my restless heart goes ♪

464
34:37.350 --> 34:41.449
♪ Never dreamed I'd love you this much ♪

465
34:41.480 --> 34:44.870
♪ There's nothing more to say about us ♪

466
34:44.900 --> 34:47.929
♪ You're the answer I never asked ♪

467
34:47.949 --> 34:51.989
♪ Without a doubt, this love will last ♪

468
34:52.020 --> 34:53.020
Do you think...

469
34:55.900 --> 34:57.690
we're going to make it through tonight?

470
34:58.860 --> 35:00.140
Watch your mouth.

471
35:00.390 --> 35:01.820
Don't jinx us.

472
35:10.590 --> 35:11.470
Here.

473
35:12.820 --> 35:13.820
What's this?

474
35:15.000 --> 35:15.870
A necklace.

475
35:23.940 --> 35:25.100
My mom gave it to me.

476
35:25.910 --> 35:27.750
My name, "Tiwakorn,"

477
35:28.140 --> 35:29.250
means the sun.

478
35:34.300 --> 35:35.570
I'm giving it to you,

479
35:36.640 --> 35:39.380
so you have to watch the sunrise with me tomorrow.

480
35:39.400 --> 35:40.380
Got it?

481
35:45.990 --> 35:47.100
P'Ing.

482
35:47.260 --> 35:48.060
Yeah?

483
35:51.330 --> 35:53.140
If we make it through tonight,

484
35:54.410 --> 35:55.860
will you be my boyfriend?

485
36:00.270 --> 36:01.860
Seriously, so you're just now realizing

486
36:01.880 --> 36:02.610
how great I am?

487
36:08.320 --> 36:09.450
Go to sleep now.

488
36:10.010 --> 36:12.080
Someone will come for us tomorrow

489
36:13.450 --> 36:14.800
after the storm dies down.

490
36:15.570 --> 36:16.520
Get some sleep.

491
36:17.420 --> 36:18.970
Take good care of my mom's necklace.

492
36:19.000 --> 36:20.890
If you lose it, you're dead.

493
36:21.290 --> 36:25.300
♪ Never dreamed I'd love you this much ♪

494
36:25.320 --> 36:28.900
♪ There's nothing more to say about us ♪

495
36:28.920 --> 36:31.810
♪ You're the answer I never asked ♪

496
36:31.830 --> 36:36.770
♪ The crack I didn't know I had ♪

497
36:39.030 --> 36:47.110
♪ Until I found you ♪

498
37:40.930 --> 37:41.910
P'Ing,

499
37:42.520 --> 37:43.850
the rain has stopped.

500
37:52.120 --> 37:52.920
P'Ing,

501
37:53.610 --> 37:55.080
the sun is coming out.

502
38:01.380 --> 38:02.300
P'Ing?

503
38:03.110 --> 38:04.050
Hey.

504
38:04.890 --> 38:05.730
P'Ing...

505
38:13.310 --> 38:15.340
You said we'd watch the sunrise together, didn't you?

506
38:16.260 --> 38:18.290
P'Ing...

507
38:18.570 --> 38:20.500
P'Ing.

508
38:38.460 --> 38:40.400
Oh, you're finally awake.

509
38:40.460 --> 38:41.740
Here is your phone, sir.

510
38:41.760 --> 38:43.360
I've already charged it for you.

511
38:43.410 --> 38:45.110
I'll leave it right here.

512
38:46.590 --> 38:47.550
The rescue team brought you

513
38:47.570 --> 38:49.740
and another gentleman in.

514
38:49.970 --> 38:52.200
You were unconscious for several hours.

515
38:52.220 --> 38:54.580
How is that gentleman who was with me?

516
38:55.460 --> 38:57.560
The doctor gave him a fever reducer,

517
38:57.590 --> 38:58.930
but he hasn't woken up yet.

518
38:59.070 --> 39:01.750
He's being monitored in the room right next door.

519
39:05.150 --> 39:06.640
Don't try to move yet.

520
39:06.990 --> 39:08.130
You're still on an IV drip.

521
39:08.170 --> 39:10.150
The doctor said you need plenty of rest.

522
39:10.180 --> 39:10.900
Okay.

523
39:12.900 --> 39:13.990
Please get some rest.

524
39:50.120 --> 39:51.310
Sweetie...

525
39:54.340 --> 39:55.590
Have you eaten yet?

526
39:57.350 --> 39:58.750
I'll go get your medicine.

527
39:59.000 --> 40:00.760
Eat something so you can take your meds, okay?

528
40:54.720 --> 40:55.520
P'Ing?

529
40:57.530 --> 40:59.110
What the hell is going on?

530
41:00.350 --> 41:01.470
Don't tell me...

531
41:03.820 --> 41:04.850
you've been holding me

532
41:04.880 --> 41:06.800
since we were rushed here.

533
41:09.070 --> 41:09.990
I haven't.

534
41:11.540 --> 41:14.840
Then why are you clinging to me like this?

535
41:14.910 --> 41:16.930
Is there a shortage of hospital beds?

536
41:17.690 --> 41:18.850
That's not it, either.

537
41:19.160 --> 41:20.370
I see.

538
41:21.070 --> 41:24.390
You must have just been waiting...

539
41:24.420 --> 41:26.460
for the chance to cuddle up with me in bed.

540
41:29.240 --> 41:30.040
P'Ing,

541
41:32.760 --> 41:34.490
about what I said yesterday...

542
41:34.750 --> 41:36.220
You mean about last night?

543
41:38.900 --> 41:40.890
What about it? I don't seem to remember.

544
41:44.850 --> 41:46.350
Are you going back on your word?

545
41:56.580 --> 41:58.880
I'll marry into your family.

546
41:59.180 --> 42:00.050
As for you,

547
42:00.080 --> 42:01.760
you have to be my bottom, though.

548
42:01.780 --> 42:03.170
This is actually nice.

549
42:03.190 --> 42:03.700
P'Ing.

550
42:03.720 --> 42:05.720
When something good happens to you,

551
42:05.750 --> 42:07.340
it's natural to look radiant.

552
42:07.370 --> 42:09.020
It's about that tryout at the boxing gym.

553
42:09.050 --> 42:10.300
They want to sign me to a contract

554
42:10.330 --> 42:11.920
and have me train in America.

555
42:12.150 --> 42:13.830
But there's some good news.

556
42:14.000 --> 42:15.130
I know him better than anyone.

557
42:15.150 --> 42:16.110
My brother...

558
42:16.130 --> 42:17.510
hates nothing more than being lied to.

559
42:17.870 --> 42:19.620
The second you helped me,

560
42:19.640 --> 42:20.580
you'd already betrayed him.

561
42:20.590 --> 42:21.300
Itt...

562
42:22.330 --> 42:24.440
Are we still friends?
